  "content": "# 第41题\n\n**题型**: 解答题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n41. Where did Tom get the idea for the original model for the Fun Bottle?\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nTom got the idea from observing his mum make healthy fruit infusions and struggle for a take-along option.\n\n",
